elected development scope photographs remain excluded.\n- V2 observations remain separate from the matched V1 dataset. The approximately 8% V3 net design-volume reduction is a reduced-function estimate; 240 W USB-PD EPR remains a future objective.\n- XeLaTeX/latexmk build, document completeness, source/archive integrity and ZIP CRC/member hashes verified. Routine underfull spacing and existing math-font substitution warnings remain.\n\nDownload **Thesis_V1_V2_V3.pdf** for the complete thesis and **Thesis_V1_V2_V3_Source.zip** for all 490 current editable source files. **SHA256SUMS.txt** contains their SHA-256 hashes.\n\nThe tag remains on the original repository reference commit. GitHub's automatic “Source code” archives contain that older checkout; use the attached thesis source ZIP for the current work.\n"}